\u1ecbch","datePublished":"2022-11-04T13:28:42+07:00","dateModified":"2022-11-04T13:28:43+07:00","commentCount":1,"mainEntityOfPage":"https://phuotvivu.com/blog/37-dia-diem-dep-va-noi-tieng-o-gia-lai-hap-dan-khach-du-lich/#webpage","image":{"@id":"https://phuotvivu.com/blog/37-dia-diem-dep-va-noi-tieng-o-gia-lai-hap-dan-khach-du-lich/#primaryimage"},"articleSection":"Gia Lai,Vi\u1ec7t Nam"},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://phuotvivu.com/blog/author/nhung/#author","name":"Nhung Phung","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https://phuotvivu.com/blog/#personlogo","url":"https://phuotvivu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/nhung-phung-phuotvivu.jpg","caption":"Nhung Phung"},"description":"Nhung l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t travel blogger v\u00e0 c\u0169ng l\u00e0 founder c\u1ee7a Phuotvivu. M\u00ecnh th\u00edch vi\u1ebft l\u00e1ch v\u00e0 chia s\u1ebb nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec3m \u0111\u1ebfn h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn v\u00e0 kinh nghi\u1ec7m du l\u1ecbch b\u1ee5i v\u1edbi mong mu\u1ed1n gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi Vi\u1ec7t \u0111i kh\u1eafp th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi. Nhung \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t m\u00ea nh\u1eefng tr\u00f2 ch\u01a1i du l\u1ecbch m\u1ea1o hi\u1ec3m, trekking, l\u1eb7n t\u1ef1 do v\u00e0 kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 nh\u1eefng n\u01a1i \u00edt ng\u01b0\u1eddi bi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn. Hi\u1ec7n Nhung \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ebfn 31 \u0111\u1ea5t n\u01b0\u1edbc \u1edf Ch\u00e2u \u00c1, \u00c2u v\u00e0 M\u1ef9 v\u1edbi h\u01a1n 200 th\u00e0nh ph\u1ed1. Nh\u1eefng Nhung th\u00edch nh\u1ea5t l\u00e0 Nh\u1eadt B\u1ea3n, Ladakh (\u1ea4n \u0110\u1ed9), Ba Lan, M\u1ef9 v\u00e0 Croatia.","sameAs":["https://vi-vn.facebook.com/Phuotvivu/","https://www.instagram.com/phuotvivu/","https://www.youtube.com/c/Phuotvivu-du-lich-bui"]}]}</script> <link rel='dns-prefetch' href='//maps.googleapis.com' /><link rel='dns-prefetch' href='//fonts.googleapis.com' /><link rel='prefetch' href='https://phuotvivu.com/blog/wp-content/themes/flatsome/assets/js/flatsome.js?ver=be4456ec53c49e21f6f3' /><link rel='prefetch' href='